  "description": "Single storey side extension; first floor rear infill extension; alterations and extension to roof; rear dormer; three rooflights in front roof slope; external alterations",
  "development_type": "Other house holder developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed roof alterations and&amp;nbsp;extension and&amp;nbsp;rear dormer in conjunction with the proposed first floor side infill extension, by reason of poor design,&amp;nbsp;would result in a discordant, awkward and ungainly cumulative addition to the dwelling and would unbalance the pair of semi detached dwellings, to the detriment of the character and appearance of the host dwelling and the street scene.&amp;nbsp; The proposal&amp;nbsp;would therefore fail to meet the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024) and is contrary to Policy D3.D (1) and (11) of the London Plan (2021), Policy GR1 of the Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041) and the adopted Harrow Supplementary Planning Document Residential Design Guide (2010).&lt;/p&gt;"
